\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {G.1}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Dev-prompt mechanism diagnostics.} The late-profile correction starts late, and the response to a band-gain change differs across prompts. (a)\nobreakspace  {}Mean $|\qopname  \relax o{ln}g-\qopname  \relax o{ln}\tau |$ over spatial rotary pairs per step: median and interquartile band over eight dev prompts, seed 0, with both targets on the NTK{} base. In the gray region the late-profile correction is exactly zero in all eight prompts (steps 1 to 19, $\sigma \geq 0.64$). \emph  {Right:} median corrections for pairs 0--11; pairs 12--27 are identically zero. (b)\nobreakspace  {}Width-axis response matrices for dev prompts 0 to 2, seed 0. Each cell is the same-seed finite-difference change in final-latent log power divided by $\qopname  \relax o{ln}(1.5)$ when one input octave receives a $1.5\times $ logit gain on both spatial axes throughout sampling. The matrices share one zero-centered color scale and are not averaged across prompts; no seed-to-seed uncertainty is estimated.\relax }}{33}{figure.caption.81}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:mechanism}{{G.1}{33}{\textbf {Dev-prompt mechanism diagnostics.} The late-profile correction starts late, and the response to a band-gain change differs across prompts. (a)~Mean $|\ln g-\ln \tau |$ over spatial rotary pairs per step: median and interquartile band over eight dev prompts, seed 0, with both targets on the \ntk {} base. In the gray region the late-profile correction is exactly zero in all eight prompts (steps 1 to 19, $\sigma \geq 0.64$). \emph {Right:} median corrections for pairs 0--11; pairs 12--27 are identically zero. (b)~Width-axis response matrices for dev prompts 0 to 2, seed 0. Each cell is the same-seed finite-difference change in final-latent log power divided by $\ln (\NmechProbeFactor )$ when one input octave receives a $\NmechProbeFactor \times $ logit gain on both spatial axes throughout sampling. The matrices share one zero-centered color scale and are not averaged across prompts; no seed-to-seed uncertainty is estimated.\relax }{figure.caption.81}{}}
\newlabel{fig:mechanism@cref}{{[figure][1][2147483647,7]G.1}{[1][32][]33}}
